{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the ranger of a pristine natural reserve, living in quiet harmony with the wilderness. Your days are spent watching, documenting, and protecting the birds that call this place home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That is until \u2588\u2592\u2592\u2593\u2591\u2592\u2588 try to enter and make it theirs.<br>Protect nature. At all costs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short but impactful open-world horror experience (~60 minutes).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Observe, catalog, and find every bird in the reserve.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make difficult choices to defuse a tense, escalating conflict.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a handcrafted open world full of secrets and hidden locations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story about nature, guardianship, and the cost of protection.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3979870?t=1764849253","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3979870?t=1764849253","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979870/023118e07bd039c7eb5bd3e316bcacf0dd67ccbd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764849253","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979870/023118e07bd039c7eb5bd3e316bcacf0dd67ccbd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764849253","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the ranger of a pristine natural reserve, l